{
  "camel_example": "aliyun ehpc ListNodes --region cn-hangzhou --ClusterId 'ehpc-hz-FYUr320000'",
  "cmd_full_name": "ehpc list-nodes",
  "cmd_name": "list-nodes",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Queries the list of nodes in a specified cluster",
  "description_zh": "调用ListNodes查询指定集群中的节点列表",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun ehpc list-nodes --cluster-id ehpc-hz-FYUr320000 --api-version 2018-04-12 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET",
  "multi_version": true,
  "name": "ListNodes",
  "operation": {
    "action": "ListNodes",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2018-04-12",
    "method": "GET",
    "operation_type": "read",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "ehpc-hz-FYUr32****",
      "help_en": "The ID of the cluster that you want to query.\n\nYou can call https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/87116.html to obtain the cluster ID",
      "help_zh": "待查询的集群ID。\n\n您可以通过调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/87116.html获取集群ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "cluster_id",
      "options": [
        "--cluster-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ClusterId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Manager",
      "help_en": "The type of the node. Valid values:\nManager: management node\nLogin: logon node\nCompute: compute node",
      "help_zh": "节点类型。取值范围：\nManager：管控节点\nLogin：登录节点\nCompute：计算节点",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "role",
      "options": [
        "--role"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Role",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "test-HostName",
      "help_en": "The name of the node. Fuzzy match is supported. MySQL regular expressions are supported",
      "help_zh": "节点名称，支持模糊查询，支持MySQL的正则表达式",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "host_name",
      "options": [
        "--host-name"
      ],
      "raw_name": "HostName",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The page number. Pages start from page 1",
      "help_zh": "显示的页码，起始值为1",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "page_number",
      "options": [
        "--page-number"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageNumber",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "10",
      "help_en": "The number of entries per page. Valid values: 1 to 100.\n\nDefault value: 10",
      "help_zh": "每页显示的条数。取值范围：1~100\n\n默认值：10",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "100",
      "name": "page_size",
      "options": [
        "--page-size"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageSize",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "Forward",
      "help_en": "The sorting order of the node list. Valid values:\nForward: Ascending order.\nBackward: Descending order.\n\nDefault value: Forward.\n\nThis parameter is used together with SortBy. For example, if SortBy is set to AddedTime and Sequence is set to Forward, nodes are sorted by the time when they were added to the cluster in ascending order",
      "help_zh": "节点列表排序方式。取值范围：\nForward：正序排序。\nBackward：逆序排序。\n\n默认值：Forward\n\n和SortBy同时使用，如SortBy设置为AddedTime，Sequence设置为Forward，表示按节点加入时间正序查询",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "sequence",
      "options": [
        "--sequence"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Sequence",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "AddedTime",
      "help_en": "The sorting method of the node list. Valid values:\nAddedTime: sorted by the time when the node was added to the cluster.\n\nHostName: sorted by the hostname of the node",
      "help_zh": "节点列表排序方式。取值范围：\nAddedTime：按加入时间排序\n\nHostName：按节点主机名称排序",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "sort_by",
      "options": [
        "--sort-by"
      ],
      "raw_name": "SortBy",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "{\"status\":\"running\"}",
      "help_en": "The filter option for node status.\n\nThe value format is {\"status\":\"node_status\"}. Replace node_status with the status of the node. Valid values:\n\nuninit: Installing.\nexception: Abnormal.\nrunning: Running.\niniting: Initializing.\nreleasing: Releasing.\nuntracking: Not added to the cluster.\nstopped: Stopped",
      "help_zh": "节点状态过滤选项。\n\n取值格式为：{\"status\":\"node_status\"}，请将其中node_status替换为节点的状态。节点的取值范围为：\n\nuninit：安装中\nexception：异常\nrunning：运行中\niniting：初始化中\nreleasing：释放中\nuntracking：未加入集群\nstopped：已停止",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "filter",
      "options": [
        "--filter"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Filter",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "172.16.**.**",
